DETAIL strict_multi_assignment check of extra_warnings is active.
HINT Make sure the query returns the exact list of columns.
DO
> DO $$ DECLARE r pc; BEGIN SELECT 1 INTO r; SELECT * INTO r FROM pc WHERE false; SELECT * INTO r FROM pc LIMIT 1; END $$;
WARNING 42804 number of source and target fields in assignment does not match (PL/pgSQL function inline_code_block line 1 at SQL statement)
DETAIL strict_multi_assignment check of extra_warnings is active.
HINT Make sure the query returns the exact list of columns.
